            "wrapper": {
                "width": "",
                "class": "",
                "id": ""
            },
            "default_value": "The cross-functional roles that have to implement the CRA. It is relevant to anyone who touches a product that falls under the CRA, not just the security team - and no prior CRA knowledge is required. Best attended as a team - you leave with a shared vocabulary and an aligned view of who does what.",
