                "width": "",
                "class": "",
                "id": ""
            },
            "default_value": "Each day combines expert-led instruction with guided discussion and worked examples. Participants work through real CRA requirements and map them to realistic products - whether software, connected hardware or industrial systems, with practical rather than hypothetical scenarios. Because the course is designed for cross-functional groups, product, engineering, legal and security teams build a shared understanding of the law and what it means for their work. It ends with a structured action-planning session, so teams leave with concrete next steps rather than just notes.",
